** Opener after responder's raise or notrump over a one-level overcall

Responder's single raise (6--10) is passed with a minimum, invited with 16--17
(accepted with 9--10) and raised to game with 18+; the limit-raise cuebid is
accepted with 14+ (a major at game, a minor in 3NT) and otherwise answered by
the cheapest rebid of the suit; the preemptive jump raise ends the auction.
Responder's 1NT (7--10) is raised to 2NT with 16--17 (accepted with 9--10) and
to 3NT with 18+; 2NT (11--12) is raised with 14+.

#CUT opener-after-major-raise
4\M = {prio:2} 18+ hcp
  #PASTE after-chain
3\M = {prio:1} 16--17 hcp
  (P)
    4\M = {prio:1} 9--10 hcp
      #PASTE after-chain
    #PASTE pass-chain
  (any)
    #PASTE pass-chain
#PASTE pass-chain
#ENDCUT

