** Balancing: advancing the reopening bid

The balancing overcall (6--16) is raised with three-card support (to the three
level with 12+, a single raise with 7--11); the balancing 1NT (10--15) is
raised to 3NT with 12+ and invited with 10--11; the jump overcall is passed.
The balancing double is answered like a direct takeout double (`competition.bml`),
and the partnership then stops.

