** The doubler's rebid after the advance

After a minimum advance the takeout doubler raises with four-card support
(one level with 17--18, two levels with 19+) or bids 1NT/2NT with 18--19
balanced and a stopper, and otherwise passes; opposite the invitational jump
he bids game in a major with four-card support and 14+, 3NT with a stopper and
14+; opposite 1NT (8--10) he bids 3NT with 17+. Advancer then passes. The same
applies to the balancing double.

